With every iOS update, Apple adds new features to the AirPods. In <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ios-27/">iOS 27</a>, the AirPods work with <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/siri/">Siri</a> AI, and there's a long-requested custom EQ option.<br/>
<br/>
